- The code (tools/, web/, layout/) is under the MIT License, below.
- The data (graph/, ontology/, shapes/, basemap/, and the RDF and JSON the build writes) is under the
  Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License (CC BY 4.0): https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Third-party data included:

- basemap/territories.json is derived from Cliopatria v0.2.1 by the Seshat Global History Databank, CC BY 4.0:
  Bennett et al., "Cliopatria - A geospatial database of world-wide political entities from 3400BCE to 2024CE",
  Scientific Data 12, 247 (2025), doi:10.1038/s41597-025-04516-9. Changed: South Asian polities only, outer rings,
  coordinates rounded to 0.01 degrees.
- basemap/world.json is derived from Natural Earth (public domain), https://www.naturalearthdata.com
- graph/wikidata.ttl is generated from Wikidata (CC0), https://www.wikidata.org

